§§ `s 11, Schedule 3 cl 1 -- gifts`

`relative` MEANS `my mother, father, spouse, child, stepchild, brother, sister, half-brother, half-sister or grandchild`
`partner's relative` MEANS `such a relative of my registered or domestic-relationship partner`
`friend` MEANS `a close friend of mine`
`stranger` MEANS `someone else`

-- Arguments: prescribed form; executed; express words; Schedule 3 wording; recipient; seasonal or event; donation;
-- reasonable value.
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `relative` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `partner's relative` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `friend` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A birthday gift to a stranger is outside cl 1(2)(a); a customary donation to a stranger is within (b).
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `stranger` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `stranger` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A relative, but no season or event and no donation.
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `relative` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Unreasonable value.
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `relative` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No authority at all (s 11(1)); express words in the document's own terms.
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `relative` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE `stranger` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not a prescribed power.
#ASSERT `Can my attorney give this gift of my property` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE `relative` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

